+/** A conditional tail (`.theme-turning`) holds only as a COMPOUND of the consumer's chain: never
+ *  inside `:not(…)`, never as a prefix of a longer name (`.theme-turning-done`), and (VERB X16)
+ *  inside `:is()`/`:where()` only when EVERY arm carries it — `html:is(.theme-turning, .x) .y`
